This software is for educational and research purposes only. Trading financial 
instruments involves substantial risk and may result in significant financial 
losses. Past performance is not indicative of future results.

The developers and contributors of Planet ProTrader are not responsible for any 
financial losses incurred through the use of this software. Users should:

- Only trade with capital they can afford to lose
- Thoroughly test strategies on demo accounts first
- Understand the risks involved in automated trading
- Comply with all applicable regulations in their jurisdiction
- Seek professional financial advice when appropriate

By using this software, you acknowledge that you understand these risks and 
accept full responsibility for your trading decisions.